{"name":"Twilight Jungle","hex":"#7e664b","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"twilight","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The soft light in the sky seen before the rising and (especially) after the setting of the sun, occasioned by the illumination of the earth’s atmosphere by the direct rays of the sun and their reflection on the earth.","The time when said light is visible; the period between daylight and darkness."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Pertaining to or resembling twilight; faintly illuminated; obscure.","Synonym of mesopelagic (“Describing the pelagic zone of the ocean between the photic epipelagic and the aphotic bathypelagic zones, characterized by very minimal light.”)"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/twilight"},{"term":"jungle","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A large, lush, undeveloped, humid forest, especially in a tropical region, thick with vegetation and wildlife; a tropical  rainforest.","Any uncultivated tract of forest or scrub habitat."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["(Of musical beat, rhythm, etc.) resembling the fast-paced drumming of traditional peoples of the jungle."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/jungle"}],"entries":[{"title":"Twilight","blocks":[{"text":"Twilight is daylight illumination produced by diffuse sky radiation when the Sun is below the horizon as sunlight from the upper atmosphere is scattered in a way that illuminates both the Earth's lower atmosphere and also the Earth's surface. Twilight also may be any period when this illumination occurs, including dawn and dusk."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d1/Twilight_description_full_day.svg/330px-Twilight_description_full_day.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Twilight","wikidata":"Q164160"},{"title":"Jungle","blocks":[{"text":"A jungle is an area of land covered with dense forest and tangled vegetation, usually in tropical climates. Application of the term has varied greatly during the past century. Because jungles occur on all inhabited landmasses and may incorporate numerous vegetation and land types in different climatic zones, the wildlife of jungles cannot be straightforwardly defined."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ef/%E1%9E%96%E1%9F%92%E1%9E%9A%E1%9F%83%E1%9E%80%E1%9E%98%E1%9F%92%E1%9E%96%E1%9E%BB%E1%9E%87%E1%9E%B6.jpg/330px-%E1%9E%96%E1%9F%92%E1%9E%9A%E1%9F%83%E1%9E%80%E1%9E%98%E1%9F%92%E1%9E%96%E1%9E%BB%E1%9E%87%E1%9E%B6.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jungle","wikidata":"Q191086"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a3/Twilight_December_30%2C_2016.jpg/500px-Twilight_December_30%2C_2016.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a3/Twilight_December_30%2C_2016.jpg/1280px-Twilight_December_30%2C_2016.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a3/Twilight_December_30%2C_2016.jpg/500px-Twilight_December_30%2C_2016.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Twilight over a lake","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ATwilight_December_30%2C_2016.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/59/ISS042-E-295982_-_View_of_Earth.jpg/500px-ISS042-E-295982_-_View_of_Earth.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/59/ISS042-E-295982_-_View_of_Earth.jpg/1280px-ISS042-E-295982_-_View_of_Earth.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/59/ISS042-E-295982_-_View_of_Earth.jpg/500px-ISS042-E-295982_-_View_of_Earth.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Twilight as viewed from space","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AISS042-E-295982_-_View_of_Earth.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/94/Top_of_Rock_Cropped.jpg/500px-Top_of_Rock_Cropped.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/94/Top_of_Rock_Cropped.jpg/1280px-Top_of_Rock_Cropped.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/94/Top_of_Rock_Cropped.jpg/500px-Top_of_Rock_Cropped.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Midtown Manhattan during civil twilight, demonstrating blue hour","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ATop_of_Rock_Cropped.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e8/Blue_hour_twilight_in_the_Mojave_desert%2C_California_2017.jpg/500px-Blue_hour_twilight_in_the_Mojave_desert%2C_California_2017.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e8/Blue_hour_twilight_in_the_Mojave_desert%2C_California_2017.jpg/1280px-Blue_hour_twilight_in_the_Mojave_desert%2C_California_2017.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e8/Blue_hour_twilight_in_the_Mojave_desert%2C_California_2017.jpg/500px-Blue_hour_twilight_in_the_Mojave_desert%2C_California_2017.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Civil twilight in a small town in the Mojave Desert","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABlue_hour_twilight_in_the_Mojave_desert%2C_California_2017.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons